# RE = Read Email (Anwenden-gated auto + manual fallback)

**Chat scope:** Email processing chat only (`EMAIL-PROCESSING-AGENT.md`).

**Always stick to the processing form:** Full 7-step output from **sprinklr-read-answer-email** SKILL.md.

**AI model (ABSOLUTE):** Model picker stays **Auto**. **Grok is banned.**

## When user sends **RE** / **re**

1. Run default extract arm (Anwenden-gated):
   ```powershell
   Set-Location "c:\Users\PC ENTER\Desktop\Citrix"; uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py
   ```
2. Script prints **`ANWENDEN_RE_ARMED`** and waits for a **left-click** on Sprinklr **Anwenden**:
   - `button[data-action-id="validateMacro"]`
   - preferably `data-tracker-event-id="@macro/editableMacroBox/UNIVERSAL_CASE"`
3. On that click: script waits **3 seconds**, then clicks the first visible  
   `button[data-testid="collapsed-case-item"]`, extracts the case, prints **CUSTOMER EMAIL** + **`RE_PENDING_SOUND`**.
4. Output full **7-step RE** (sections 1–7). Section **7. Summary of response** must be the **last** segment.
5. **Audio (automatic):** Project hook plays Prowler after section 7 when pending. Manual: **`sound`**.
6. User sends **PR** / **LF** when ready.
7. **Mandatory after PR + LF both complete** for that Fall #: **immediately re-arm** Anwenden-gated RE (same command as step 1). Do **not** wait for the user to type **RE** again. See **Auto-arm after PR+LF** below.

### Manual extract (currently open case, no wait)

```powershell
uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py --once
```

Use when the case is already open and you do not need Anwenden → auto-open.

## Auto-arm after PR + LF (mandatory)

When **both** paste (**PR**) and Case Tracker fill (**LF**) have finished successfully for the **same** Fall #:

1. **Immediately** start Anwenden-gated RE (do not ask, do not wait for the user to type **RE**):
   ```powershell
   Set-Location "c:\Users\PC ENTER\Desktop\Citrix"; uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py
   ```
2. Confirm in chat briefly: e.g. `Anwenden RE armed for next case.` Expect **`ANWENDEN_RE_ARMED`** in the script output.
3. User then clicks **Anwenden** in Sprinklr → script waits 3s → opens next case → extract → you output 7-step RE.

**When this fires**

| User command | Arm Anwenden RE when |
|--------------|----------------------|
| **PR LF** / **pr lf** | After PR paste+verify **and** LF fill both succeed |
| **PR** then later **LF** | After **LF** succeeds (PR already done for that Fall #) |
| **LF** alone with no prior PR for this Fall # | Do **not** auto-arm (incomplete case close-out) |
| **PR** alone (no LF yet) | Do **not** auto-arm yet — wait until LF finishes |

Do **not** arm twice for the same close-out. If Anwenden RE is already running from a prior arm, do not start a second overlapping process.

## 7-step output

1. Customer summary  
2. Verification  
3. Transfer eligibility  
4a/4b. Backend / instructions  
5. Instructions on handling case  
6. Your response to customer (German, code block)  
7. Summary of response (EN) — **audio after this section (hook)**

## Integrity

- One visible case only; discard prior Fall # context on each new **RE**.
- PR pastes latest RE for the **same visible Fall #** only.
- Watch loop must **not** steal browser focus (`bring_to_front`) while waiting.
- **No monitor fallback:** If Anwenden-gated RE fails, **stop and report**. Do **not** fall into continuous `monitor_emails` / `get_new_emails` loops.

## Rollback

If this experiment fails or you dislike it, in the **instructions** chat type **`revert last`** — restores checkpoint `.cursor/revert-checkpoints/pre-anwenden-re/`.

## Hooks note

Requires project hooks enabled (`.cursor/hooks.json`). View **Output → Hooks** if sound does not play.
